#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-septentrio.rst:35
#: 923abf0de1d7471a91f0a9a28f33e894
msgid ""
"The Septentrio driver currently does not use `GPS_RATE_MS` and "
"`GPS_RATE_MS2`. It is still important to set them to the expected value of "
"100 (10Hz) as they are used as weights when combining GPS results."
msgstr ""
"Septentrio 驱动目前不使用 `GPS_RATE_MS` 和 `GPS_RATE_MS2`。但仍需将其设置为预期值 100（10 "
"Hz），因为这些参数在合并 GPS 结果时用作权重。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-septentrio.rst:38
#: 0a9af9db92d74fc0867755c63aca7fe1
msgid "If you want to inject RTCM corrections to both GPS1 and GPS2 then use:"
msgstr "如果希望向 GPS1 和 GPS2 同时注入 RTCM 校正，请使用："

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-septentrio.rst:40
#: b0bd651d38d34f3091be7092bbe6583e
msgid ":ref:`GPS_INJECT_TO<GPS_INJECT_TO>` = 127 (send to all)"
msgstr ":ref:`GPS_INJECT_TO<GPS_INJECT_TO>` = 127（发送至所有）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-septentrio.rst:42
#: 2f022106c3dc4a91925d1907c34d0252
msgid ""
"Note: Baud rate is auto-negotiated by the ArduPilot firmware, and might get "
"set to something different than the 115200 baud."
msgstr "注意：波特率由 ArduPilot 固件自动协商，可能会被设置为 115200 baud 以外的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-septentrio.rst:46
#: 27de72b0af044e5ba72e7642b147be75
msgid "GPS-for-Yaw"
msgstr "GPS 偏航"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-septentrio.rst:48
#: 1929804574fe42c4845c54fe2870304f
msgid ""
":ref:`GPS-for-yaw<common-gps-for-yaw>` is possible using two separate GPSs "
"or, in ArduPilot 4.5 (or higher), a single unit with two antennas may also "
"be used."
msgstr ""
":ref:`GPS 偏航<common-gps-for-yaw>` 可使用两个独立 GPS 实现，或在 ArduPilot "
"4.5（及更高版本）中使用带双天线的单单元设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-septentrio.rst:50
#: d7d1f89b19734720a3b0d831a4eca348
msgid ""
"If a single unit with two antennas is used please set the following "
"parameters:"
msgstr "如果使用带双天线的单单元设备，请设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-septentrio.rst:52
#: 40be0c5f78204a34a19c4b08cbea6c44
msgid ":ref:`GPS1_TYPE <GPS1_TYPE>` = 26 (SBF-DualAntenna)"
msgstr ":ref:`GPS1_TYPE <GPS1_TYPE>` = 26（SBF-DualAntenna）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-septentrio.rst:53
#: 4f2350a565684f66b88563df4fa8fcba
msgid ":ref:`GPS1_MB_TYPE <GPS1_MB_TYPE>` = 1 (RelativeToCustomBase)"
msgstr ":ref:`GPS1_MB_TYPE <GPS1_MB_TYPE>` = 1（RelativeToCustomBase）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-septentrio.rst:54
#: 0d5e080febcb4be0b553b7323a07b27f
msgid ""
":ref:`GPS1_MB_OFS_X <GPS1_MB_OFS_X>`, :ref:`GPS1_MB_OFS_Y <GPS1_MB_OFS_Y>` "
"and :ref:`GPS1_MB_OFS_Z <GPS1_MB_OFS_Z>` to match the offset of the main "
"antenna from the second in meters.  For example if the second antenna is "
"50cm to the right of main antenna set :ref:`GPS1_MB_OFS_Y <GPS1_MB_OFS_Y>` ="
" -0.5."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`GPS1_MB_OFS_X <GPS1_MB_OFS_X>`、:ref:`GPS1_MB_OFS_Y <GPS1_MB_OFS_Y>` "
"和 :ref:`GPS1_MB_OFS_Z <GPS1_MB_OFS_Z>` 设置为主天线相对于第二天线的偏移量（米）。例如，若第二天线在主天线右方 "
"50 cm，则将 :ref:`GPS1_MB_OFS_Y <GPS1_MB_OFS_Y>` 设置为 -0.5。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-septentrio.rst:55
#: 77021c458bd245afa1c71205aa816127
msgid ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW <EK3_SRC1_YAW>` = 2 (GPS)"
msgstr ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW <EK3_SRC1_YAW>` = 2（GPS）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-septentrio.rst:57
#: bd211cd747dc4e89bf8609cf74369aa5
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`Antenna Offsets<antenna-offsets>` section for a diagram "
"illustrating the directions of these offsets."
msgstr "请参阅 :ref:`天线偏移<antenna-offsets>` 章节中的示意图，了解这些偏移方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-septentrio.rst:59
#: 843afa6b319f4cc0b76ee87a83c27f40
msgid ""
"Note that the yaw calculation is only correct while the vehicle is upright, "
"so it should not be used on vehicle that spend significant time at extreme "
"lean angles (e.g tail sitters)."
msgstr "请注意，偏航计算仅在机体保持水平时正确，因此不应用于长时间处于大倾斜角的飞行器（如尾座式飞机）。"

